==Trivia==
*In real life, [[wikipedia:Sirius|Sirius]] is a star in the constellation Canis Major and the brightest star in the night sky.
**Canis Major's name is Latin for "greater dog", hence the [[Treasure]] of this stage being a Big Dog.

